Bookshelf shows the books in KOReader's home folder
To change it, tap the top of the screen for the menu
Tap "Close Bookshelf" to reach KOReader's file browser
Go up a level to see the folder that holds your books
Long-press that folder
Tap "Set as HOME folder", then confirm
Back to the shelf: menu > "Open Bookshelf"
Bookshelf now shows the books in that folder
